synopsis.en:
Si Hyeonu is a second-year university student who never quite fits in.
One day, he helps an old man and drinks a suspicious medicine. From then on, his life takes a complete turn—.

Chaeran, the beautiful manager of his officetel building;
Ayeong, the working woman next door;
Jiwon, a gorgeous fitness trainer;
Seyeon, his aloof fellow student;
and even Rebecca, a cool, intellectual professor—all become so infatuated with Hyeonu that they nearly lose their reason?!

Ever since he drank that suspicious medicine, pheromones have poured from his body.
He spends his days indulging his desires with the women around him.
But when it comes to Huiwon, the one he truly loves, he is reluctant to seduce her with pheromones…
